{# ST-03 - back-cover HARD CTA. DATA comes pre-shaped from patterns/st_03.py;
   this template COMPOSES the geo_shapes overlay + the QR macro on the token-themed
   full-bleed .st-03 layout (styles/st_03.css). Fragment only - no <html>/<head>/
   <style>/@page/@font-face/:root (those live in the head).

   Richard's closing SKELETON (apex/NMR/boss back covers): a LOWER-WEIGHTED
   composition on a full-bleed dark authority ground - deliberate textured dark
   space up top (the quiet geo motif), then the content clustered in the lower
   portion: a short serif headline + supporting line, a DESIGNED CTA cluster (a thin
   accent rule → an uppercase label → the PROPORTIONATE accent URL on the left with
   the QR beside it), and a centered wordmark sign-off at the very bottom.

   The URL is the BARE DOMAIN (scheme stripped in st_03.py) sized at --type-h2 (a
   confident, contained CTA - NOT the page's biggest type / a naked oversized
   string, which read as crude). It fires in --color-accent: high-contrast on the
   dark --color-ink ground. The QR (white box) sits beside it as one CTA unit.

   WeasyPrint: the bleed block carries an explicit min-height (the full A4 sheet)
   so its dark background paints (an abspos inset:0 bg child paints 0 ink); the
   geo_shapes container + the content column are real children, so the block is
   never empty. #}
{% from 'geo_shapes.jinja' import geo_shapes %}
{% from 'qr.jinja' import qr %}

<div class="cta-bleed"{% if ground_uri %} style="--cta-ground: url('{{ ground_uri }}');"{% endif %}>
  {# the geo motif fills FLAT navy; over a real atmosphere ground it floats as
     a random shape, so it only renders when no ground asset resolved (st_03.py
     mirrors that: it passes variant=None when a ground is present). #}
  {% if not ground_uri %}{{ geo_shapes(variant) }}{% endif %}
  {# the giant ghost section numeral (the deck's recurring device) fills the
     deliberately quiet upper dark zone — Richard's closing pages carry the
     oversized page number as a designed watermark, never a dead void. #}
  <div class="cta-ghost" aria-hidden="true">{{ ghost_number }}</div>
  <div class="cta-content">

    <div class="cta-head">
      {% if eyebrow %}<div class="cta-eyebrow">{{ eyebrow }}</div>{% endif %}
      {% if headline %}<h1 class="cta-headline">{{ headline }}</h1>{% endif %}
      {% if body_html %}<div class="cta-body">{{ body_html }}</div>{% endif %}
    </div>

    {% if url %}
    <div class="cta-action">
      <div class="cta-rule"></div>
      <div class="cta-action-row">
        <div class="cta-action-text">
          {% if cta_label %}<div class="cta-label">{{ cta_label }}</div>{% endif %}
          <div class="cta-url">{{ url }}</div>
        </div>
        {% if qr_svg %}<div class="cta-qr">{{ qr(qr_svg) }}</div>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if wordmark %}<div class="cta-wordmark">{{ wordmark }}</div>{% endif %}

  </div>
</div>
